    <string name="help_create_text">Describe what you want (or dictate it, or attach a photo). Acornix writes a full web app live and you can try it straight away. Then apply the suggested improvement or ask for your own changes: every change is a new version.</string>
    <string name="help_feature_title">Functionalities</string>
    <string name="help_feature_text">They replace the Python plugins of the Termux version. They are apps that can use window.Acornix to vibrate, turn on the flashlight, speak, read the battery, send notifications or ask the AI.</string>
    <string name="help_assistant_title">The assistant</string>
    <string name="help_assistant_text">Ask for anything in natural language: “turn on the flashlight in SOS”, “search Nirvana videos on YouTube”, “set an alarm at 7”, “create a piano and open it”. You\'ll see each step it takes and can stop it at any time.</string>
    <string name="help_control_title">Total control</string>
    <string name="help_control_text">Enable “Acornix total control” in Android\'s Accessibility settings and the assistant will be able to read the screen and tap or type inside other apps. It asks before sending messages, calling, paying or deleting, and never sees passwords.</string>
    <string name="help_apps_title">Your apps</string>
    <string name="help_apps_text">Tap to open full screen, long-press for more options: improve, edit code, versions, add to the home screen, share or delete.</string>
    <string name="help_versions_title">Versions</string>
    <string name="help_versions_text">Nothing is ever lost: you can restore any previous version from the timeline.</string>
    <string name="help_share_title">Share</string>
    <string name="help_share_text">Export any app as a ZIP and send it to whoever you want. ZIPs from the original acornix are also imported.</string>
    <string name="help_keys_title">API keys and privacy</string>
    <string name="help_keys_text">Your key is encrypted with the Android Keystore and only sent to the provider you choose. Generated apps run locally on your phone.</string>
    <string name="help_origin_title">Where does it come from?</string>
    <string name="help_origin_text">Acornix was born as a terminal assistant for Termux. This app brings all of it to a modern interface, no terminal required.</string>
